  "details": "1. Load into a world suboptimally\n\nPossible results:\n\n- Certain Load conditions (common on Quest but platform agnostic, I've had it happen on PCVR) can cause AudioSources with Play On Awake to fail playing entirely.\n\n- I got stuck on \"Connecting...\" due to an unrelated issue and the Play On Awake audio (world ambience) started playing in the loading screen\n\nMy Workaround as a World Creator: \n\nHave a script enable the component/gameobject/gameobject parent on Start so it can't 'Awaken' too early\n\nI only selected the platforms I've confirmed this issue on personally, but I suspect it applies to all of them",
